Package: picklerick
Title: Fast Single-Cell Format Conversion via SCX
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("ben", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "ben.uzh@proton.me"),
    person("Atreya", "Choudhury", role = "aut",
           email = "atreyachoudhury@hotmail.com"))
Description: R bindings to the SCX streaming interop engine for single-cell
    genomics. Reads AnnData (.h5ad and Zarr), H5Seurat, 10x HDF5, 10x
    MatrixMarket and BPCells files into SingleCellExperiment or Seurat
    objects, or wraps the matrix in a DelayedArray that reads cells on demand.
    Converts between formats through a memory-bounded streaming pipeline and
    inspects file metadata without loading the matrix. No Python dependency.
